sw-global-war-supply-return-storage = { $point }, { $planet } — temporary storage without order acceptance or payment.
sw-global-war-supply-approve-arsenal = Approve arsenal for the outstanding remainder
sw-global-war-supply-approve-help = This decision does not move or accept cargo. It creates no new order or payment reservation. If the remainder changes, review the updated data and act again.
sw-global-war-supply-allowed-arsenals = Approved arsenals: { $points }. Current outstanding remainder: { $count }.
sw-global-war-supply-quote-arsenals = Once placed, this order will permit acceptance at these arsenals: { $points }. The first point is primary. This preview reserves nothing.
sw-global-war-supply-auto-route-wait = The automatic program is waiting for a permitted route. No obligation or new money, item or space reservations have been created. Checks repeat within the current window. Unused quota does not carry over after the window ends.
sw-global-war-supply-transport-part = Order #{ $number }, part { $part }. { $leg }. Receiving arsenal: { $recipient }. Actually accepted for this order: { $accepted }; outstanding: { $outstanding }.
