sw-global-war-supply-arsenal-changed = The decision changed: selected order #{ $oldOrder }, remainder { $old }; current order #{ $order }, remainder { $current }. Explicitly reload the decision before approving the arsenal.
sw-global-war-supply-arsenal-reload = Reload decision for the current remainder
sw-global-war-supply-order-route-blocked = Delivery of this order is blocked: no permitted route is available. The outstanding obligation and payment reservation remain. Wait for the route to be restored; the war minister or head may cancel the unfulfilled remainder.
sw-global-war-supply-order-parts = Order #{ $number } in Shipments: parts { $parts }.
sw-global-war-supply-failure-returnpending = Cancellation is incomplete: reserved goods await return. The original return point is unavailable. Restore an eligible store at the same position, then check the return.
